ckms uninstall: compare the version of the installed module

The directory of the installed module is named after the version, not
name=version, so the guard returned for every installed module and
uninstall never removed anything.

diff --git a/ckms b/ckms
--- a/ckms
+++ b/ckms
@@ -689,7 +689,7 @@
 
     slinkr = slinkp.resolve()
     # installed module does not match this...
-    if slinkr.is_dir() and slinkr.parent.parent.name != pkg.pkgver:
+    if slinkr.is_dir() and slinkr.parent.parent.name != pkg.version:
         return
 
     slinkp.unlink(missing_ok = True)
